! Logfest 2010/jbonunsla 2010



Logfest 2010 took place from April 30 - May 2 at [http://www.penguicon.org/|PenguiCon] 2010 in Troy, Michigan, and was a great success.  Nine serious Lojbanists attended, and we attracted something 3 or 4 newbies.  Courtesy of Axis, a picture of most of the attendees, and a couple of newbies, during a lesson: {IMG(attId="707" thumb="y")}a picture of most of the attendees, and a couple of newbies, during a lesson{IMG}.



! LogFest 2009/jbonunsla 2009



LogFest 2009 was at PenguiCon 2009, from 1 May 2009 through 3 May 2009.  We are extremely fortunate that ((Matt Arnold)) is both the  ConChair of PenguiCon and a Lojbanist, so we have great space set aside for us!  See the ((jbonunsla 2009)) page for details.



